  built + read back. PfGolfer_Test created with 6 sockets + both clubs. ROOT CAUSE FOUND:
  ModelImporter.bakeAxisConversion=true (SPEC §5.1) CORRUPTS the Humanoid avatar — HumanPose
  bodyRotation went to (73.8,0,0) and muscle values to |6.67| (valid range +/-1). Set to false:
  bodyRotation (355.6,180,0), maxAbs 1.83, and the retarget renders correctly. Impact frames
  measured on the socketed club: Drive t=1.167s, Putt t=1.333s.

2026-09-06T06:43:43Z  iter-1 complete. Real-gameplay verification on Hole 08: 27 PASS / 1 FAIL
