2026-09-06T07:31:32Z  Three defects fixed after review of the first video:
  (1) swing was gutted by the camera cut — AnimatorCullingMode.CullUpdateTransforms stops transform
      writes off-frustum, so the swing froze at the cut. Culling now suspended for the swing;
      proven by sampling Swing_Drive 0.07->0.35 at vis=False, then Idle.
  (2) club was not held — socket origin sat at the two-hand midpoint, 0.104 m ACROSS the grip from
      hand_r. Re-solved through the right fist: fist-to-shaft-line 0.0000 m, driver 69.7deg, scale 1.000.
  (3) found while fixing (2): every serialized reference on the prefab was NULL. A compile with the
      define OFF makes the guarded class fieldless and Unity drops the data; re-enabling does not
      restore it. Prefab re-wired AND Awake now resolves both club roots by name.
  Invariants re-run after the rewire: 27 PASS / 1 FAIL (tri budget) — unchanged.
  Final video is take 5; the putter beat was dropped because the game refuses putter mode at a tee.

